CosyVoice2-Stutter

This is an independent research derivative of FunAudioLLM/CosyVoice.
Upstream: https://github.com/FunAudioLLM/CosyVoice
Upstream code license: Apache License, Version 2.0.
Original per-file copyright and attribution notices are retained.

This distribution was assembled from a local research snapshot, not a verified
checkout of a particular upstream commit. Local changes predate this release;
their complete upstream diff cannot be reconstructed from the available files.

Research additions/adaptations include normal/stutter control tokens, annotated
speech recipes, fine-grained instruction tuning, instruct tuning, and batch synthesis.
Release changes include documentation, environment and source checks, explicit
dependencies, import-path setup, portable defaults, and strict prompt exclusion.

